# ticklore.com/gala is the address a person guesses and the one that fits on
# a printed ticket, but the gala page is served by the app. Forward rather
# than copy the page here — two copies drift, and the one on the flyer is
# always the stale one.
#
# 302 and not 301 on purpose: if the gala page ever moves onto this site, a
# permanent redirect would sit in people's browser caches sending them away
# long after it stopped being true.
/gala       https://app.ticklore.com/gala   302
/gala/*     https://app.ticklore.com/gala   302
